1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,019
Could you hear with your tummy?

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:05,479
Well, Hop can! Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,193
Hop's ears are on its tummy!

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,715
Hello in there! It's an eardrum. Sound makes it wiggle!

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,297
Six legs? In you go!

6
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:21,700
Sorry! My tummy! Can YOUR tummy hear things?
